java/out/

# Keep directory placeholders and the committed demo artefacts that make the
# repository readable (and GitHub Pages renderable) without running anything.
# Nested directories must be un-ignored before their contents: git never
# descends into an excluded directory.
!data/raw/gtfs/
!**/.gitkeep
!dashboard/data.json
!reports/strategy_report.md
!reports/figures/*.png
